OL,3,GNEWSADrought permit issued in bid to
OL,4,Asecure supply
OL,5,
OL,6,FA drought permit has been approved as
OL,7,Fone of south-west England's strategic
OL,8,Freservoirs runs "exceptionally low".
OL,10,FThe Environment Agency has issued the
OL,11,Fpermit to South West Water to help
OL,12,Fsecure the public water supply.
OL,14,FWater levels at Wimbleball reservoir in
OL,15,FExmoor, Somerset, which supplies water
OL,16,Fto 390,000 people, are "exceptionally
OL,17,Flow", with storage at 18% of capacity,
OL,18,Fcompared with 30% at the same time in
OL,19,F2025, the Environment Agency said.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
