OL,3,GNEWSADrought permit issued in bid to
OL,4,Asecure supply
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe permit will allow the water company
OL,7,Fto pause normal compensation flow to
OL,8,Fthe River Haddeo temporarily. It will
OL,9,Falso need to release the same volume of
OL,10,Fwater downstream for abstraction from
OL,11,Fthe River Exe for public supply.
